.Dd March 12, 2026
.Dt REQUEST_IRQ 9
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm request_irq
.Nd register an interrupt handler
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In sys/irq.h
.Ft int
.Fn request_irq "unsigned int irq" "irq_handler_t handler" "unsigned long flags" "const char *name" "void *dev_id"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn request_irq
function registers an interrupt handler for the specified IRQ line.
Shared lines require
.Dv IRQF_SHARED
for all participating handlers.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
0 is returned on success.
Otherwise a negative error code is returned.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr free_irq 9 ,
.Xr irq_shared 9
